<title>MALTA: Maltese T-bill yields ease at auction.</title>
<headline>Maltese T-bill yields ease at auction.</headline>
<dateline>VALLETTA 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Malta Treasury said Friday it issued 1.074 million Maltese lira in 182-day Treasury bills maturing on March 14, 1997.</p>
<p>The weighted average yield rate is 5.2884 percent a year, slightly down from the previous 182-day issue of July 12, 1996 which had a yield of 5.2897 percent.</p>
